          "dialogue.28.recruit.0": "I will read the situation before drawing a blade.",
          "dialogue.28.growth.0": "I will show my training on the battlefield.",
          "dialogue.28.recruit.1": "My weapon is ready.",
          "dialogue.28.growth.1": "Every strike deserves discipline.",
          "dialogue.28.battle.0": "I will read the situation before drawing a blade.",
          "dialogue.28.battle.1": "Comrades, advance together!",
          "dialogue.28.boss.0": "An enemy general will not make me retreat.",
          "dialogue.28.boss.1": "Break the escorts, then face their general.",
          "dialogue.28.victory.0": "This victory belongs to all of us.",
          "dialogue.28.victory.1": "Tend the wounded and regroup.",
          "dialogue.28.idle.0": "Time to inspect our blades and armor.",
          "dialogue.28.idle.1": "Catch your breath and prepare for battle.",
